<p id="A2.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Relative to the decomposition
<math id="A2.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathfrak{H}=\mathfrak{H}_{\mathsf{P}}\oplus\mathfrak{H}_{\perp}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ℌ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ℌ</mi><mi>𝖯</mi></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>ℌ</mi><mo>⟂</mo></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathfrak{H}=\mathfrak{H}_{\mathsf{P}}\oplus\mathfrak{H}_{\perp}</annotation></semantics></math>, we write an operator
<math id="A2.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝖳</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{T}</annotation></semantics></math> on <math id="A2.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathfrak{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ℌ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathfrak{H}</annotation></semantics></math> in block form as</p>